{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_2_2_1:heading\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"2.2.1 研究药物\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_2_2_1:product-identity-features\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物为 AD-101。研究药物的产品身份应可回溯至当前产品权威；其剂型、规格、理化性质等适用特征应在本章中明确。当前产品权威的版本与定位：【待补充：研究药物当前研究者手册或等效产品权威文件的版本与定位：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。剂型、规格、理化性质等产品特征：【待补充：研究药物的剂型、规格、理化性质等产品特征：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。化学结构/分子式的适用性应给出结论（适用或不适用）及理由；【待补充：化学结构/分子式的适用性结论及理由：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"evidence:source:db97597a305a74992da8b2e02ee70017186d03e065a1a1e911865d0f1031d5b8\"\n      ],\n      \"source_locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/4:p\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_2_2_1:mechanism\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本药作用机制为继承性义务，属于本章声明的实质补充；现有源资料未显式包含作用机制表述，不应将源文反向引用为已含证据。本药作用机制及其证据来源：【待补充：本药作用机制及其证据来源：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"dea6051c4bd0dd314fefbd13d93052a5ea5cc400eccb29fcc895d4a852450e40"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:2fcaa1a3a21fa738c2d261b036febdc842ef334ddaff3e15b8095753367f1d8d:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:2fcaa1a3a21fa738c2d261b036febdc842ef334ddaff3e15b8095753367f1d8d:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"37a5de8a5cb2a42195872c7414841630104609bbb741d6e421303a7e745fec58","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e